            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-018-measurement-corneal-endothelium-chord-median-theta-120>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-018-measurement-corneal-endothelium-fraction-within-15-deg>,
