            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-018-measurement-verdict-supported-1-mixed-0-5-refuted-0>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-018-morphometric-validation-1>,
